<BaseLayout title="Methodology | Sanatana Path" description="How Sanatana Path creates simple, source-aware explanations."><article class="container content reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Trust and editorial method</p><h1 class="display">Simple for beginners. Transparent for serious learners.</h1><p class="lead muted">Sanatana Path separates source references, traditional interpretations, and simplified learning explanations. No single interpretation is presented as universally final.</p><h2>Before publication</h2><p>Every topic requires explicit references, tradition context, review metadata, and named human review. Draft pages are clearly marked and excluded from search indexing.</p><h2>What this platform does not do</h2><p>It does not publish AI-generated content automatically, copy copyrighted commentary, or allow public edits.</p></article></BaseLayout>
